# STR header is shorter than its 2-byte count
53 54 52 20 01 00 00 00 03
# STRx declares 3 strings but contains only one complete offset
53 54 52 78 08 00 00 00
03 00 00 00 08 00 00 00
# STR has an unterminated string, a header offset, and an out-of-bounds offset
53 54 52 20 0A 00 00 00
03 00 08 00 07 00 63 00 4F 4B
